                                                "sense_id": "893ad553-fb6b-3867-851c-3326409895c9",
                                                "text": "His colorful life span might be regarded as the story of an adventurer rather than that of an artist; despite his lengthy involvements in many of the arts--painting, fiction, theater, and film--one often feels from his autobiography that it was the adventures that counted most for him."
